#subtitle: Setting the party's ideological direction.

= Questions of Ideology

The <span style="color: #c00000;">**Marchers**</span> is torn between many different ideological currents. What should be our primary ideological guidance for now?

[? if ideology != 0 : We have previously chosen a [+ ideology +] ideology. Changing it will likely have drawbacks. ?]

- @class_struggle: Class struggle and preparing the proletariat for the revolution are our primary goals.
- @centrist: The Center <span style="color: #9B0000;">Vaelism</span> of Corwin Vael remains the best way to resolve our internal contradictions.
- @labor: We should work with the Free Guilds to improve the lives of workers.
- @reform: Following Eduard Revane, we should work for ethical <span style="color: #c00000;">Reformism</span>, strengthen democracy, and expand the party's electorate.
- @socpat: Pursue the fusion of <span style='color: #c00000;'>Reformism</span> and patriotism.
- @easy_discard

@class_struggle
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.ideology && Q.ideology != "left") {
    Q.changed = 1;
}
!}
go-to: changed if changed = 1
on-departure: ideology = "left"; left_strength += 8; communist_coalition += 1; left_dissent -= 5; reformist_dissent += 5; unionist_relation -= 3; gold_relation -= 5; ddp_relation -= 3; lvp_relation -= 3; ddp_cohesion -= 0.5; nationalization_support += 1; collectivist_relation += 3; ddp_right += 1; gold_right += 1.5; lvp_right += 1

The radical left of the party supports a course of class struggle, and potentially a reconciliation with the <span style="color: #700000;">**Collectivists**</span>.

@centrist
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.ideology && Q.ideology != "centrist") {
    Q.changed = 1;
}
!}
go-to: changed if changed = 1
on-departure: ideology = "centrist"; center_strength += 8; center_dissent -= 10; left_dissent -= 5; reformist_dissent -= 5

The Center Vaelists, represented by Vael and Bell, support a middle course of preparing for revolution while building up the consciousness of the working class.

@labor
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.ideology && Q.ideology != "labor") {
    Q.changed = 1;
}
!}
go-to: changed if changed = 1
on-departure: ideology = "labor"; labor_strength += 8; center_dissent += 5; wtb_support += 1; labor_dissent -= 5; collectivist_relation -= 3

The labor wing of the party supports continued participation in government in order to provide benefits to the workers, and the creation of public works programs for employment.

@reform
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.ideology && Q.ideology != "reformist") {
    Q.changed = 1;
}
!}
go-to: changed if changed = 1
on-departure: ideology = "reformist"; reformist_strength += 8; democratization += 1; reformist_dissent -= 5; left_dissent += 5; unionist_relation += 5; gold_relation += 5; ddp_relation += 5; lvp_relation += 5; collectivist_relation -= 8; moderate_plan_support += 1; gold_left += 1; ddp_left += 0.5; ddp_cohesion += 0.5; lvp_left += 1

The reformist wing of the party seeks to preserve the Republic and the democratic system of government, and is most supportive of coalitions with the other pro-democracy parties.

@socpat
view-if: social_patriot
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.ideology && Q.ideology != "socpat") {
    Q.changed = 1;
}
!}
go-to: changed if changed = 1
on-departure: ideology = "socpat"; social_patriot_strength += 10; left_dissent += 10; center_dissent += 10; reformist_dissent += 5; unionist_relation += 6; gold_relation += 6; ddp_relation += 6; lvp_relation += 6; collectivist_relation -= 15; gold_left += 1; ddp_left += 0.5; ddp_cohesion += 0.5; lvp_left += 1

The social patriot wing of the party, widely regarded as Staal's puppets, is the most supportive of the <span style='color: #c00000;'>**Marchers**</span> and Greater Worker's Guild adopting a more nationalist stance.

@changed
on-arrival: left_dissent += 5; center_dissent += 5; labor_dissent += 5; reformist_dissent += 5

We have changed ideologies. Many in the party feel unmoored.
